  "scope": "Use range projections directly in generated kernel bounds",
  "validation": "Both generators replay with unchanged data; paired builds of both targets and production wrappers pass. All 88 target and 36 wrapper name/type/axiom reports, 55,118 global simp entries and 23,324 instances match. Direct provider source/object receipts match.",
